  "note": "Election of 12 members for the two wards of Warrenpoint Urban District on 17 May 1967. Both East and West Wards were contested. Irish Labour gained one seat from the Unionists; the long-serving Unionist George M'Nellis was unseated. Eight candidates for five seats.",
